{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "8a6bf27349f0af3e36ffff3f43a3fab21357336b6083c639253b4e853f120703", "ja": "笑顔は花咲くように", "zh": "笑容宛如花朵绽放", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "60513788cfc958e7612b9b7b38e7c39e56c092e9d8a35b3979bcb71cbfdd3f4e", "ja": "可憐の先導で辿り着いたのは、プロデューサ\r\nーも知らない劇場の部屋。可憐はこれが自分\r\nの秘密と言い、秘密がなくても一緒に作ろう\r\nと星梨花を元気づける。PVの撮影もうまく\r\nいき、4人は笑顔をこぼすのだった。", "zh": "在可怜的带领下到达的，是连制作人\n也不知道的剧场房间。可怜说这就是自己\n的秘密，并鼓励星梨花说就算没有秘密，\n也可以一起创造。PV的拍摄也很顺利，\n4人都不禁展露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e98cef1a69595d740e8b853c8fb3f69488f08b3ac9eaff1f8ff4b12299d8679b", "ja": "（秘密がないと悩む星梨花に、可憐が声をかけて\nくれた。私についてきてと言われたが……）", "zh": "（可怜向为没有秘密而烦恼的星梨花搭话了。她让我跟着她走，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bdba5038387a87ba137efd0e9274ccdd9bbdd69716d2df1fc8b00a7953fd698d", "ja": "可憐、一体どこに連れて行くつもりなんだ……？", "zh": "可怜，你到底打算带我们去哪里啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "d2eb046c01c23d00ff4b0a32cdcdf6dda68f848a05faa0d3769fea5e1832e02d", "ja": "可憐さんの秘密を、\nお話してくれるんですよね？", "zh": "是要告诉我\n关于可怜小姐的秘密，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "51514c9d83b8bf66added1556a9cbc828bdfe787cd839683b0aa071b7c06251b", "ja": "うん……こ、言葉で伝えるより、見たほうが\n早いと思うから……こっちに……。", "zh": "嗯……我、我觉得比起用语言表达，直接看\n会更快一些……请往这边走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fe15d343d32e0724d9091aa829382988f709dd82d333612c2be35bcf0b5a4d94", "ja": "（階段を降り、奈落の奥へと進んだ先には……）", "zh": "（下了楼梯，继续往后台深处走去之后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "c33a5bee46b202b8ff30a99773fd17aa4b8495efca2966f8e8bed517cd2c26d6", "ja": "わあ……！　こんなところにお部屋が……！？\nわたし、初めて知りました！", "zh": "哇啊……！这种地方居然有房间……！？\n我还是第一次知道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "32a006d9e497f9c3f508c3aac44df99bde284e5384d9e349e4e202a9b867d411", "ja": "なんだここは……俺も知らないぞ。\nステージの中に、こんな部屋があったなんて……。", "zh": "这是什么地方……连我都不知道。\n没想到舞台里面竟然还有这样的房间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "046aa3067641a0b27605d64a8952188904eba47d00517cddc36a8e4b1d98b1ef", "ja": "い、いつかの本番前……緊張して\nウロウロしていた時に、見つけたんです……。", "zh": "是、是有一次正式演出前……我太紧张了\n到处转悠的时候，偶然发现的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "b788f27fe63b44aed7f172ab1471a4cf01e0664e8c4c8c4a4adcd554f80e27f3", "ja": "私たちのステージの、ち、地下に当たる\nみたいで……さっきまで私、ここにいて……。", "zh": "好像是我们舞台的……地、地下……我刚才一直在这里……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e34d77fe8c62dab1ae0777fbbe5b358f73e1d9551f961e5765666b474c7fd260", "ja": "だからお互い声だけ通ってたのか。おそらく、舞台と\n連携して使う予定の部屋だったんだろうな……。", "zh": "原来如此，难怪彼此只能听到声音。这里大概是原本打算和舞台配套使用的房间吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "30a02c09c4bc0abbeb5c05a13d9a775b57954c780a63c4f41f4cb970432b590a", "ja": "すごい……！　なんだか\n隠れ家みたいで、ドキドキします！", "zh": "好厉害……！感觉像是秘密基地一样，让人心跳加速！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "54516d42afe9fb39ac9fb94349bd936455ba86dd01f2ada181166d9560344380", "ja": "く、癖の強いアロマも、ここなら迷惑かけないし……\nひとりになりたい時、く、来るんだ……♪", "zh": "气、气味浓烈的香薰，在这里也不会给别人添麻烦……\n想一个人的时候，就、就来这里……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "175e7a517fb45cbd42f86515b6e39303f6ac971a17967db287eaaf9d626da4f2", "ja": "あの、星梨花ちゃん……。ひ、秘密がないなら……\n作っちゃえば、いいんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "那个，星梨花……要、要是没有秘密的话……\n那就自己创造一个，不就好了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "ddde0337c43049f7bcf5d40203a68d0cda45fe0a1286cd5b29b5ba887fb5437a", "ja": "え？\n秘密を、作っちゃう……ですか？", "zh": "诶？\n要、要创造秘密……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "7e3338333b0f4748fb12b153e5e35dae058a77c89e6d2009a208ddf81453dfa0", "ja": "うん。た、たくさんお話したら……きっと、\nいくらでも秘密なんて作れちゃうと思うから……。", "zh": "嗯。要是、聊得很多很多的话……我想一定，\n不管多少秘密都能创造得出来的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "be39432bdcb1e3cdc79c0743b00b429de47e75ab496dc6cef2d9b70303ec299e", "ja": "でも、秘密を作るだなんて……\nわたし、どんなお話をすればいいか……。", "zh": "可是，要制造秘密什么的……\n我、我该说些什么才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9293e22a4e78d359fd78fe47b26f52bc6ca0c0573fb8016be47812f55f3daabf", "ja": "ちょうどいいのがあるじゃないか。\nさっき俺に話してくれた、あの話をすればいい。", "zh": "不是正好有一个吗？\n把刚才跟我说的那个故事讲出来就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "caf8dbf6331f91079f117df729ae88cd99b41e23f39f5084e1588ff9f5000c63", "ja": "あれは、でも……。", "zh": "那个，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c8fb027f2bf92a3b01dc38411dc9b4bea46d7d469c43af80c8ead3278a9fc9eb", "ja": "そうだな。なら星梨花は、どうしてあの話を\n3人じゃなくて、俺に相談しに来たんだ？", "zh": "是啊。那么星梨花，你为什么不去找3人商量，反而来找我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "8eb18f695ea5e1778205c31cb0add794c0cbb38ded0a26c786b53fae8247da0d", "ja": "それは……みなさんにお話するには、\nちょっとだけ勇気が出なくて……。", "zh": "那是因为……要跟大家说的话，我有点鼓不起勇气……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "286f0896528c31a3b0d6c5cb2f68c1f84e0a70c7f5cb5fa3aa0f894ba6f8bc92", "ja": "少し言いにくかったんだよな。星梨花の心の、\n少し奥にある気持ち……秘密の気持ちだから。", "zh": "之前确实有点说不出口吧。因为那是藏在星梨花心底深处的一点想法……是属于你的小秘密嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142", "ja": "あっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e4f0378a4cac21d3e1970c95ea4cc1ee37f1f27575096a068e7139004651b1cb", "ja": "星梨花に、秘密はないのかもしれないけど……\nみんなの前でなら、秘密が作れるのかもしれないな？", "zh": "星梨花或许没有什么秘密可言……不过，在大家面前，说不定就能创造出秘密了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "0750e8e6bbefe700f02e8706f9b42a9eab5f560fa82710a3533af8008e5e08ae", "ja": "それに、そういう秘密を打ち明けてもいいのが、\nこの会……4人でのおしゃべりだと思う。", "zh": "而且，我觉得，能把那样的秘密说出来的，就是这场……和4人一起的聊天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "5a1842ce54e660cbcb2a0c1aa5f1ee190a9b450daf4eac436aa53b6e0289726b", "ja": "モヤモヤしたり不安なこと、ひとりで抱えるのはつらい\nから……そういう時こそ、お、おしゃべりしよう……？", "zh": "烦闷或不安的事情，一个人憋在心里很难受\n所以……所、所以这种时候，就聊聊天吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "b00c160b8870ad65f55f3f1274cadcb536ab74349287c7d8d6a200d1a0174670", "ja": "あっ。も、もちろん、星梨花ちゃんが\n良ければ、だけど……。", "zh": "啊。当、当然，如果星梨花\n愿意的话，不过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "38cfbaeaeede6e6c0b92e21ef17d10f71953740b03ad2668a434f7bf8b9e36a7", "ja": "はい！　それは、もちろん……\nそうですよね……わたしの、秘密の気持ち……。", "zh": "是的！那当然……  \n对吧……我那份秘密的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "79c959e9aa850c773eed9a5f53ec99452bc7db1e96bc178707414a1d20eb0af7", "ja": "可憐さんたちだったら……ううん、\n可憐さんたちに、聞いてほしいです！", "zh": "如果是可怜小姐她们的话……不对，\n我想让可怜小姐她们听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "80012e084cad64fff3c51358a29d0255621af5c028cb98dca792ed72092d3227", "ja": "うん……♪　私、な、なんでも聞くから……\nいろいろなお話、たくさんしようね……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪ 我、我什么都会听的……我们多聊聊各种各样的话题吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "e8f60f78f9d38fc8e034153c0e9d1b420e846432d68b7d70601df31c68a72590", "ja": "はい！　たくさんおしゃべりをして、たくさん\n秘密を作りたいです！　……みなさんと、一緒に！", "zh": "好的！我想和大家聊很多很多，制造很多\n只有我们知道的秘密！……和大家一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "8142b5ceedb5ead817a6e2abb0c5851cc10efc98fb8a29f1652f9a2249fc3463", "ja": "こんなところに部屋が……あっ、本当にみんな\nいるべさ！　美也さん、目がいいんだねぇ。", "zh": "这种地方居然有个房间……啊，大家真的都在这里呢！美也，你眼神真好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "4297b223ea7d2318d719b42f7e4a74efe29716a9e42e45bd220e68a63f29dce2", "ja": "あの後ろ姿は、絶対に可憐ちゃんたちだと\n思いましたから～。追いかけてきて正解ですな～。", "zh": "我就觉得那个背影肯定是可怜她们～追过来果然没错呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "1bf39db1875be2dc6ad3bef755427c07f71432217455107e21720b93f4e51c3d", "ja": "あ……ひ、ひなたちゃんに美也さん……！\nちょうどいいタイミング……♪", "zh": "啊……日、日向和美也小姐……！\n来得正是时候……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "c963c188a6364e43637bde3faedb0142ead9f188d23284258b728b32e47228be", "ja": "美也さん、ひなたさん！\nわぁ、おふたりもいらしたんですね！", "zh": "美也小姐、日向小姐！哇，原来两位也来了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "7ca594c1ce0f20b34ec937661e95ac5158ad3007edcd706636af20c8e443e8a4", "ja": "あの！　今日は、可憐さんの秘密だけじゃなくて……\nわたしの秘密も、聞いてもらえますか？", "zh": "那个！今天不仅是可怜小姐的秘密……\n也能请你们听听我的秘密吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "713437ae32753d38ceecfb50fed73068cfb6e97239403e0cdb045c708dd6e06e", "ja": "おお～。豪華二本立てというわけですな～。\nそれは楽しみです～。", "zh": "哦哦～也就是说，今天是豪华双重惊喜啊～。\n真让人期待呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1036_035hin", "source_sha256": "df092f08991d7c50880daa330f2067a8a661159408d3e0ace1497d981c835825", "ja": "ええと……？　話がどんどん進んじゃって、\n頭がこんがらがってきたねぇ……？", "zh": "那个……？话题进展得越来越快，我的脑子都开始乱起来了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "2a4fffbc241d3d0eb4a17c62909899fab982a1e070c8bc23c9bea2ee713642c6", "ja": "そ、そうだよね……。まずはこの部屋の\nお話からしないと、い、いけないよね……。", "zh": "对、对吧……。首先得先说说这个房间的事，才、才行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "f6bfbab6e1ebda5cf066a0712ca2352681a76e9eb08b72de26378273efe350f9", "ja": "実は……こ、この部屋が私の、\nひ、秘密、なんだ……。", "zh": "其实……这、这间房间，\n就、就是我的秘密……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "5003f88146d19f56f95e18de019a56825396af7eb5faf29f80bff2126a0c3094", "ja": "（秘密を持ち寄る会、今日は長くなりそうだ。\nレッスンの時間、遅らせてあげないとな……！）", "zh": "（秘密分享会今天看来要持续很久了。得把训练时间往后推迟一点才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1040_null", "source_sha256": "00aa58ebf6289fe45b7f84a1bda002944ec0d7e1e751f2ac789131e2d24a9456", "ja": "そして、PV撮影当日……", "zh": "然后，到了拍摄PV的当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1041_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "7a9844a88fc0b1bd198a0e5b5171f694ec21a013e4b5006a0a53b258e08a33d5", "ja": "カーット！　以上でクランクアップでーす！\nお疲れ様でしたー！", "zh": "咔——！到这里就杀青啦！\n辛苦了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1042_kantoku", "source_sha256": "fa262997ed553671b4cf9411a70849f0f70dba2320ff108c635ed893e6dbea0b", "ja": "みんな、とっても素晴らしかったわ！\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "大家都表现得非常出色！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1043_045kar", "source_sha256": "796aab0832f040de186ee96bdd6fac418fb83416386765ff39692cfd94c0e956", "ja": "ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "谢谢大家……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
