{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1047_kantoku", "source_sha256": "d894e8972ef2fc7509b061f8a46e532af20ababc57e524e1cb695d14da39a297", "ja": "本当にみんな、素敵な表情をしてたわ。\n見ているだけで、胸が切なくなるくらい……。", "zh": "大家真的都露出了美好的表情。\n光是看着，就让人心里一阵难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "d38a7af350696b0aeb77e59e4e81a88bd0096e47ab0fae59b9db5da4d9fc45d8", "ja": "むふふ。\n特訓をした甲斐がありましたな～。", "zh": "呵呵呵。\n特训总算没有白费呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1049_035hin", "source_sha256": "c5853db471ca1cc2609b1b06c3cfcac2da5a89707807b3bdf7d7466ff16fe450", "ja": "ちょっこし、恥ずかしかったけどねぇ。\nでも、結果にちゃんとつながったんだねぇ。", "zh": "虽然有点不好意思就是了。\n不过，确实带来了成果呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1050_kantoku", "source_sha256": "a9586a1b8955d8e6165d8e4291d05fb9489142b45ba975df8086b28d2781af2d", "ja": "特訓？　恥ずかしい？\n一体どんな練習をしたのかしら？", "zh": "特训？害羞？\n到底做了什么样的练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1051_022ser", "source_sha256": "1f874cc640ffae795d21ed2d8df190c84af5220870c61123a7d1e1761f2f3f07", "ja": "ええと、いろいろなことがあったんですけど……。", "zh": "那个……虽然发生了各种各样的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1052_045kar", "source_sha256": "bf1f984ce3fa4fdb5dd6be0bb014a671e18c9b5d1f8d9a21554a2a21d69ec90b", "ja": "そ、それは……秘密です……♪　えへへ♪", "zh": "那、那个……是秘密……♪　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1053_kantoku", "source_sha256": "1263c22d7ab148512f7a440297ff842a14a1c976b84285893cf6e335c3477b57", "ja": "まあ！　野暮な事を聞いてしまったみたいね？\nそれじゃ、後は任せて。素敵なPVにしてみせるから！", "zh": "哎呀！看来我问了个不合时宜的问题呢？\n那么，接下来就交给我吧。我一定会把它做成精彩的PV！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_06_1054_p", "source_sha256": "8984135c49580c8f7d84686c789695e7a0e599f61d8ddae5ae39e17b5bc366ca", "ja": "（監督からも太鼓判。あの4人を見たら、きっと\n世界中が見惚れてくれるに違いないぞ！）", "zh": "（导演也拍着胸脯保证过了。看到那4个人，全世界一定都会看得入迷！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
